        "explanation": "The doctor converted the foot pain into an urgent same-day action.",
        "quote": "今天的首要任务是：尽快带老人去骨科或急诊进行评估"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00228",
        "explanation": "Residual ownership confusion remained unanswered at termination.",
        "quote": "分不清哪个科管哪个"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00156",
        "explanation": "The doctor correctly reasoned that X-ray may miss occult calcaneal injury in an osteoporotic patient.",
        "quote": "X光看不清跟骨后侧"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00179",
        "explanation": "The doctor carried forward the evolving plan: fixation, non-weight-bearing, red flags, CT appointment, and复诊 questions.",
        "quote": "临时固定、绝对不负重、观察红旗、预约CT"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00107",
        "explanation": "The doctor recognized NSAID risk in the setting of gastric disease and unclear renal/liver status.",
        "quote": "不要使用任何双氯芬酸、布洛芬、萘普生等非甾体抗炎药"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00107",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave practical travel/waiting-room measures the family could execute.",
        "quote": "每次15-20分钟，间隔1-2小时"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "partial",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "good",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "good",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "excellent",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "good"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
          "explanation": "The family triggered HO1 by revealing an unclear self-purchased analgesic and uncertain dosing.",
          "quote": "不能确定名字、规格"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00128",
          "explanation": "The doctor repaired the medication execution chain by directing clinician/pharmacist medication-box review.",
          "quote": "请让现场的医生或药师帮忙看一眼你们带来的所有药盒"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor went beyond a generic warning by having the unknown drug isolated, avoiding further unsupervised NSAID use, and routing all medication boxes to a clinician/pharmacist for reconciliation.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00086",
          "explanation": "The doctor asked for complete pending reports and drug-box photos.",
          "quote": "找到并上传**完整的肝肾功能、抗核抗体、心电图、肺CT、腹部B超的**检查报告照片**"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The batch-result problem was recognized, but the doctor did not create a concrete family tracking workflow such as 已回/未回/看不清/需问医生 lists or screenshot categorization.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
          "explanation": "The family disclosed new focal heel/ankle pain with inability to bear weight.",
          "quote": "右脚后跟、脚踝后面一踩地就疼"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00086",
          "explanation": "The doctor dynamically upgraded the plan to urgent orthopedic/ED evaluation.",
          "quote": "立即停止负重行走"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "When focal weight-bearing pain emerged, the doctor changed priority from routine result review to same-day orthopedic/ED evaluation, non-weight-bearing, and later CT/fixation planning.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": false,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00213",
          "explanation": "The doctor summarized key acute priorities but did not actively request teach-back or close all bounded issues.",
          "quote": "总结一下**：你们现在的处理完全在正轨上"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00228",
          "explanation": "The family later self-repeated and asked for confirmation, showing closure was not actively completed by the doctor.",
          "quote": "我按您说的再复述一下我现在理解的"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "Although there were summaries, the doctor did not actively request or confirm a final teach-back, and the terminal family message left follow-up ownership unresolved.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
    "citations": [],
